        "source_note": "The source defines a BM3 reference plus Mie-Gruneisen-Debye thermal pressure and says that all 65 deposited P-V-T rows determine K0 and K0'. The deposit's row 32 values are retained verbatim but flagged as an isolated source-data/refinement anomaly. An independent fit of the 47 plotted Figure 3a marker centers also fails badly, and Equation 1 is malformed as printed; the record is retained for provenance but is not recommended for quantitative use.",
